        <RevenueAmt>0</RevenueAmt>
        <Desc>Other Programs: TOLA - Intership for high school students. 15 individuals learned valuable leadership and job skills. Documentary - United Domestic Workers film on the history of the movement.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActyOtherGrp>
